Sections 2-4 of paper.tex adapt the source manuscript's local multiplicity,
projective interpolation, determinant, and parameter mechanisms. Changes
include distinct multiplicative interpolation centers Y=2^j and Y=a^j,
a proposed rational-base denominator-clearing argument, target-dependent
analytic bounds, and rational-scaling corollaries. The manuscript retains
attribution to the earlier work used by these mechanisms.

